          }
         }
        ]
       },
       {
        "title": "How much setup time can presetting eliminate?",
        "blocks": [
         {
          "type": "textmedia",
          "header": "",
          "body": "<p>If you measure just five tools on a ZOLLER presetting and measuring machine before the tools are placed on the CNC machine, you can reduce the set-up time by more than 40%.</p>",
          "images": [],
          "videos": [],
          "pos": "text",
